The package ships no terminology content. LOINC, SNOMED CT, ICD-10-CM and NCI Thesaurus codes appear in its output, its
mapping files and its tests only as the published models bind them and the records carry them.

The test fixtures under samples/ are the published packages of the NHANES Participant and NHANES Medication models of
the FAIR Data Demo (https://github.com/SemanticDataCharter/FAIR_Data_Demo, Apache 2.0) and a seeded sample of 200
records of each, generated by that project from the CDC's NHANES 2017-2018 public release.
